open main
open runtime_workload

// Timing program: the backtracking matcher alone on 2,000 random 32-bit inputs against (0|1)*0 and against
// (0|1)*1(0|1)(0|1)(0|1). Exit 0 when the counts are the regex crate's on the same inputs (997, 985).
inl main () : i32 = expect_random_counts (run_random_workloads EngineBacktrack 2000i32 32i32) 997i32 985i32
